    <briefdescription>
<para>An iterator over partitions of the alloca&apos;s slices. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This iterator implements the core algorithm for partitioning the alloca&apos;s slices. It is a forward iterator as we don&apos;t support backtracking for efficiency reasons, and re-use a single storage area to maintain the current set of split slices.</para>
<para>It is templated on the slice iterator type to use so that it can operate with either const or non-const slice iterators. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
